# Configure your XHProf or Tideways profiler. See https://vufind.org/wiki/development:profiling.
# DO NOT SET A VALUE ON PUBLICLY ACCESSIBLE SERVERS.
# Can be used instead of configuring Apache with: SetEnv VUFIND_PROFILER_XHPROF http://url...
#
# VUFIND_PROFILER_XHPROF=http://url/to/your/xhprof/web/interface
VUFIND_PROFILER_XHPROF=
